            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "i g in Kanniyakumari, Tamil Nadu, 12-year-old Rashmika was eagerly cycling to school. She was excited. That was the day her science teacher had dedicated a class for students to share and try to explain interesting observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
